Each scenario folder will contain the following after running the full pipeline:

File,	Generated by,	Description
pras_system.jls,	Build script,	Serialised PRAS SystemModel
pras_results.jls,	Build script,	Monte Carlo shortfall results
pras_stor_energy.jls,	Build script,	Storage SOC time series
pras_flow.jls,	Build script,	Interface flow results
shortfall_mean.csv,	extract_results.jl,	Mean shortfall per zone per hour (n_zones × 8760)
pras_headline_metrics.csv,	extract_results.jl,	EUE, LOLE, NEUE with uncertainty
top10_summary.csv,	worst_10_analysis.jl,	10 worst shortfall hours
capacity_factor_analysis.csv,	capacity_analysis.jl,	CF by technology
event_details.csv,	event_analysis.jl,	Individual shortfall event characteristics
dr_sensitivity.csv,	dr_sensitivity.jl,	DR sweep results
dr_regional_impact.csv,	dr_impact_analysis.jl,	EUE change per zone after DR
